Palm's Memos (com.palm.app.notes 3.0.20), as shipped on HP webOS 3.x.

Copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard. Never released under an open licence; distributed by
Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers: no owner has
asserted rights since webOS was discontinued.

Copied from the reference TouchPad, where it is pre-installed but lives in the user area of
the filesystem (/media/cryptofs/apps). The app is here as it was packaged, with one change,
codepoet's exception to rule 5 in CLAUDE.md (2026-10-14): css/memos.css ends with a block
marked [Lunacy] that runs the wall and the memo grid to the card's bottom. Palm's stylesheet
gave them the TouchPad's own heights (995 and 943 px in portrait, 739 and 687 in landscape),
which left Enyo's grey body showing under them on any card taller than a TouchPad's. Its db8 kind and permissions (configuration/db) are
registered as the device's configurator did.
